# The Raspberry Pi OS Lite (64-bit) release every image is built on. Pinned so
# a rebuild of the same VERSION starts from the same base; the build checks the
# download against BASE_IMAGE_SHA256 rather than a checksum fetched with it.
#
# To move to a newer release, follow "Updating the base image" in README.md,
# and bump VERSION.
BASE_IMAGE_URL=https://downloads.raspberrypi.com/raspios_lite_arm64/images/raspios_lite_arm64-2026-10-06/2026-10-06-raspios-trixie-arm64-lite.img.xz
